<title>USA: Pier 1 sets stock split, dividend.</title>
<headline>Pier 1 sets stock split, dividend.</headline>
<dateline>FORT WORTH, Texas 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pier 1 Imports said Thursday it declared a 3-for-2 stock split and set a quarterly dividend of $0.035 per share on a post-split basis.</p>
<p>The stock split will be effected in the form of a 50 percent stock dividend and currently, there are 45.1 million shares of common stock outstanding.</p>
<p>New shares will be distributed on July 30 to holders of record on July 16.</p>
<p>The quarterly dividend will be distributed August 27 to holder of recond on August 13.</p>
<p>The company's last dividend was $0.04 per share.</p>
</text>
